  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic.\n• In a medium saucepan, heat the plant-based butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook half the garlic, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Add basmati rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt, stir, then bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat and keep covered until the water is absorbed, 10 minutes.\n• Once the water has absorbed, stir through baby spinach leaves, until wilted. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-651135b547e375df71ee7ef4-9e7f9c7e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice zucchini into half-moons.\n• Roughly chop tomato.\n• Thinly slice long chilli (if using).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-651135b547e375df71ee7ef4-c8299c19.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken, in batches, until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-651135b547e375df71ee7ef4-aad30d13.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Wipe out pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook zucchini, tossing, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add tomato, Mumbai spice blend and remaining garlic and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-651135b547e375df71ee7ef4-70c013ca.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the pan with the veggies, stir in coconut milk and cook, until slightly thickened, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-651135b547e375df71ee7ef4-ce333507.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide spinach garlic rice between bowls. Top with plant-based crumbed chick'n.\n• Spoon over Mumbai coconut curry sauce.\n• Sprinkle over flaked almonds. Top with long chilli to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-651135b547e375df71ee7ef4-219c5b1d.jpeg"
    }
  ]
